{"unit_id":"AnLifeX__dsh-attention#card-zh","repo":"AnLifeX/dsh-attention","commit":"72cc167a3641cf6643c74753268fd58cac65fed9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-attention 是一款面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的会话提醒插件，在会话审批、提问和一轮结束时显示通知。它接入审批与提问流程，并通过客户端设置页和宿主本地路由提供自制卡片、系统通知或桌面宠物三种呈现方式。用户可在卡片上允许或拒绝审批、回答单选和多选问题、填写下一步消息，也可回到对应会话。适合需要离开 DSH 页面仍关注待处理事项的人；桌面原生提醒与宠物模式需要 Windows 和 PowerShell。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:808-920","src/index.js:1036-1041","client/client.js:1279-1296"]}
{"unit_id":"AnLifeX__dsh-attention#card-en","repo":"AnLifeX/dsh-attention","commit":"72cc167a3641cf6643c74753268fd58cac65fed9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-attention alerts DSH users when approvals, questions, or turns need attention. It offers custom cards, system toasts, or a desktop pet, where users can answer requests and return to sessions. Native desktop cards and pet mode require Windows and PowerShell.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:808-920","src/index.js:1036-1041","client/client.js:1279-1296"]}
